     1620       run proc-br-cli-hist in this-procedure no-error.
     1621     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1622   END.
     1623   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF br-cli-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1624   DO:
     1625     run proc-view-changes in this-procedure no-error.
