     1630     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1631   END.
     1632   ON RETURN OF sch-cli-code IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1633   DO:
     1634     run proc-find-obj-code in this-procedure(no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-cli-code) no-error.
     1635     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1636   END.
     1637   ON CTRL-J OF sch-corr-date IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
