     1660     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1661   END.
     1662   ON RETURN OF sch-db-num IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1663   DO:
     1664     run proc-find-db-num in this-procedure(no, input frame Dialog-Frame sch-db-num) no-error.
     1665     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
